<title>UK: Life Sciences Intl Plc year pretax rises.</title>
<headline>Life Sciences Intl Plc year pretax rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		8.7		    vs 7.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.6		    vs 4.4</p>
<p> Pretax		     23.9		   vs 20.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   230.0		  vs 204.8</p>
<p>NOTE - The pre-tax results included a charge of 7.0 million stg and an extraordinary gain of 3.7 million stg in 1996 versus charges of 1.5 million stg and 1.8 million stg in 1995.</p>
<p>Earlier, Thermo Instrument Systems Inc extended its agreed 235.9 million stg cash bid for Life Sciences International Plc to March 4.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
